---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About Kim Ely, PA-C | Clinical Navigation & Patient Advocacy"
    description="Learn about Kim Ely's 15+ years of clinical oncology and bone marrow transplant experience at Johns Hopkins and CHLA, and her mission in private patient advocacy."
>
    <header class="about-hero">
        <div class="hero-container">
            <h4>The Founder</h4>
            <h1>Meet Kim Ely, PA-C</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">
                A dedicated ally bringing over 15 years of oncology experience
                directly to your side of the table, ensuring you never have to
                navigate the medical system alone.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="story-section">
        <div class="story-container">
            <div class="story-content">
                <h2>From the Clinic to Your Corner</h2>
                <p>
                    I began my career as a Physician Assistant in private
                    practice adult oncology. Every day, I treated patients
                    facing the hardest news of their lives. But behind the
                    scenes, I saw a recurring heartbreak: families being forced
                    to navigate a maze of appointments, complex treatment paths,
                    and impenetrable medical jargon completely on their own.
                </p>
                <p>
                    When you are caring for someone you love, you shouldn't have
                    to suddenly become a medical expert. I created this practice
                    because I believe patients deserve more than just brilliant
                    doctors—they deserve a dedicated guide to translate the
                    clinical details, manage the moving parts, and make the path
                    forward clear.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-image"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="experience-section">
        <div class="experience-container">
            <h2>The Clinical Foundation</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">
                My approach to advocacy was shaped inside some of the nation's
                premier medical programs. I know what exceptional, flawless care
                looks like from the inside—and I know how to demand it for your
                family.
            </p>

            <div class="timeline-grid">
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="badge">CHLA</div>
                    <h3>Children’s Hospital Los Angeles</h3>
                    <h4>Pediatric Oncology</h4>
                    <p>
                        At CHLA, I witnessed the profound impact of fully
                        unified care. The providers I worked alongside didn't
                        operate in silos; they collaborated constantly and
                        communicated early and often with the patient's family.
                        It taught me early on that the best medicine is deeply
                        connected, and no family should ever feel out of the
                        loop.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="badge">Hopkins</div>
                    <h3>Johns Hopkins Medicine</h3>
                    <h4>Oncology & Bone Marrow Transplant Team</h4>
                    <p>
                        Serving patients through highly complex bone marrow
                        transplants, I saw how easily things can fall through
                        the cracks if someone isn't managing the big picture. My
                        role required daily coordination across dozens of
                        specialists, including oncologists, pharmacists, physical
                        therapists, and more. This experience taught me exactly how to build,
                        manage, and communicate with a truly comprehensive care
                        team.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mission-cta">
        <div class="cta-container">
            <h2>Bringing the Best of Medicine to You</h2>
            <p>
                You deserve the highest standard of care without the exhaustion
                of managing it yourself. When the stakes are too high to look
                for answers alone, I step in to speak your doctors' clinical
                language, ask the right questions, and ensure your family's
                voice is always heard.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Request a Consultation</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    /* Hero Styles */
    .about-hero {
        padding: 8rem 5% 4rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: var(--white);
    }
    .hero-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .about-hero h4 {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .about-hero .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--text-dark);
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Story Section Styles */
    .story-section {
        padding: 4rem 5% 8rem;
        background: var(--white);
    }
    .story-container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        gap: 6rem;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .story-content h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .story-content p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .story-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 55vh;
        background: url("/kim.jpg") center/cover;
        background-color: var(--bg-beige);
        box-shadow: 15px 15px 0 var(--bg-beige);
    }

    /* Experience Section Styles */
    .experience-section {
        background: var(--bg-beige);
        padding: 8rem 5%;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .experience-container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .experience-section h2 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-lead {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--text-dark);
        max-width: 750px;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .timeline-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 4rem;
    }
    .timeline-item {
        background: var(--white);
        padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
        border-top: 4px solid var(--navy);
        position: relative;
    }
    .timeline-item .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        background: rgba(65, 105, 225, 0.08);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .timeline-item h3 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .timeline-item h4 {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-dark);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .timeline-item p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* Mission & CTA Section Styles */
    .mission-cta {
        padding: 9rem 5%;
        text-align: center;
        background: var(--white);
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .cta-container {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .mission-cta h2 {
        font-size: 2.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .mission-cta p {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
    .btn-primary {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--navy);
        color: white;
        padding: 1.2rem 3.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--bg-beige);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--royal-blue);
        transform: translate(-3px, -3px);
        box-shadow: 18px 18px 0 var(--bg-beige);
    }

    /* Responsive Breakpoints */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .about-hero {
            padding: 5rem 5% 3rem;
        }
        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
        }
        .story-container,
        .timeline-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
        }
        .story-image {
            height: 40vh;
        }
        .experience-section,
        .mission-cta {
            padding: 5rem 5%;
        }
        .experience-section h2,
        .story-content h2,
        .mission-cta h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }
        .section-lead {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        .timeline-item {
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>
